scratch/
# Stray runner output at the repository root. A run's own copy under runs/ is
# part of that run's record and is committed - verify.ps1 reads it from a fresh
# clone, so the blanket ignore silently broke verification until the negation
# below was added.
conformance-result.json
!runs/*/conformance-result.json
AzDoPAT.txt
*.pat
**/pat.txt
